Description: Ghostty-powered terminal for iOS and visionOS
 A real terminal on your device, drawn by the same engine as Ghostty on the
 desktop. Your shell keeps running in the background, so a build you started
 is still going when you switch apps and still there when you come back.
 Runs on iPhone, iPad and Apple Vision Pro.
